            "review_title": "Review at Victory Restaurant Hotel",
            "review_text": "Odyssey22006853388\nChandigarh, India15 contributions\n0\nCentrally Located Victory Hotel at Ho-Chi-Minh City\nApr 2025 • Family\nVictory Hotel is a very good accomodation right in the heart of Ho-Chi-Minh City. It is very near to several tourist places, like War Memorial, Indpendence Palace and local market. Room charges are very reasonable. Rooms are comfortable. Breakfast available.\nInsider tip:\nVegetarian dishes are very less.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten April 24, 2025",
